            </note>
            <note corresp="#d30-f2" n="2" xml:id="d30-f2-content">
                <p>For texts of Khrushchev’s letter of July 23 and the President’s reply, July 25,
                    see <hi rendition="#italic">American Foreign Policy: Current Documents,
                        1958</hi>, pp. 999–1002.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d30-f3" n="3" xml:id="d30-f3-content">
