            </note>
            <note corresp="#d30-f4" n="4" xml:id="d30-f4-content">
                <p>Dulles went to London for the Baghdad Pact
                    Council meeting, July 28–31.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d30-f5" n="5" xml:id="d30-f5-content">
                <p>For text of the Tripartite Declaration, May 25, 1950, see <ref
                        target="frus1950v05#pg_167"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1950, vol. V, pp. 167</ref>–<ref target="frus1950v05#pg_168">168</ref>.</p>
            </note>
